arbeitnow:teamleiter-last-mile-logistik-:
&lt;h2&gt;Kurz und Knapp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du liebst die tägliche Abwechslung, siehst dich als (zukünftige) Führungskraft und bist bereit für eine neue Herausforderung in der Logistik, egal ob mit Fachhintergrund oder als &lt;strong data-path-to-node="22,2" data-index-in-node="180"&gt;Quereinsteiger&lt;/strong&gt;?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dann bist du bei Picnic genau richtig! Denn wir suchen nach einer (Junior) Teamleitung für unseren Last Mile Standort (Hub) in&lt;strong&gt; Frankfurt an der Oder&lt;/strong&gt;. Die Hubs werden mit unseren bereits fertig kommissionierten Waren aus dem Zentrallager (Fulfillment Center) beliefert und sind als Verteilzentrum die letzte Station unserer Logistikkette, bevor die Einkäufe beim Kunden auf dem Küchentisch landen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-rich-links="{&amp;quot;fple-t&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Teamleiter Last Mile Logistik bei Picnic&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;fple-u&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;https://youtu.be/gUawd1tvF1Q&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;fple-mt&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;first-party-link&amp;quot;}"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/gUawd1tvF1Q" width="560" height="314"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das erwartet dich&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamführung:&lt;/strong&gt; Stelle dein Team ein und coache es zum Erfolg. Du kannst auch tolle Events planen, um den Zusammenhalt weiter zu stärken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entwicklung zur Führungskraft:&lt;/strong&gt; Du managst nicht nur die Schichtpläne, sondern übernimmst die Einarbeitung und Entwicklung der Runner (Fahrer) in einem unserer Hubs, und sorgst so dafür, dass alles rund läuft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Liefermanagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Du übernimmst die Verantwortung, wenn die Lkw mit frischen Waren ankommen, und sorgst dafür, dass alles passt! Und wenn etwas fehlt, organisierst du blitzschnell Nachlieferungen – du behältst immer den Überblick über doe Logistik in deinem Standort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prozessmanagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Du hältst den Betrieb am Laufen durch einen kontinuierlich den Fokus auf unsere betrieblichen Kennzahlen (KPIs) und garantierst, dass alles sicher und wie am Schnürchen läuft, ganz nach unserem Motto: “Safety First”.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork:&lt;/strong&gt; Im engen Austausch mit dem Customer-Success Team, unserem Zentrallager (Fulfillment Center) und anderen Hubs machst du unsere Kunden glücklich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pünktliche Abfahrten:&lt;/strong&gt; Dank dir sind unsere Fahrer immer pünktlich unterwegs zu unseren Kunden, damit wir unser versprochenes Zeitfenster einhalten können.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bringe deine Ideen ein&lt;/strong&gt;: Von der Koordination der Reparatur unserer Elektrofahrzeuge über die Gestaltung des Hub Layouts bis hin zur Rekrutierung unserer Runner - deine Ideen tragen dazu bei, dass wir gemeinsam weiter wachsen können&amp;nbsp;und unsere Logistikprozesse auf ein neues Level bringen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bringst du mit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein Studium oder abgeschlossene Berufsausbildung in der Logistik oder du überzeugst als Quereinsteiger (z. B. aus Gastronomie, Hotellerie, Einzelhandel, Kundenservice).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erste Erfahrungen in der Führung von Teams - entweder im Beruf oder du hast bereits ein anderes Erfolgsteam gecoached.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Deutsch- und basic Englischkenntnisse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist im Besitz eines gültigen Führerscheins der Klasse B.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gute kommunikative Fähigkeiten und ein selbstbewusstes Auftreten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du magst es, Entscheidungen auf Grundlage von Zahlen und Fakten zu treffen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Darauf kannst du dich freuen&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Starte durch - mit uns: &lt;/strong&gt;Werde Teil unseres internationalen Teams in einem Umfeld, das echtes Wachstum und eine „Act like an Owner“-Mentalität fördert. Bei uns hast du die Chance, Projekte eigenverantwortlich. voranzutreiben, neue Ideen zu testen und direkt miterleben zu können, wie deine Arbeit in unserem schnell wachsenden Unternehmen Wirkung zeigt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nachhaltigkeit als Kern:&lt;/strong&gt; Werde Teil der Revolution. Du trägst zu einer grüneren Zukunft bei – durch unsere 100 % elektrische Flotte und eine Lieferkette, die Lebensmittelverschwendung reduziert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Basics:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir stellen dir alles für deinen Erfolg bereit – inklusive Laptop und Handy sowie Zugang zu exklusiven Mitarbeiter-Rabatten (Corporate Benefits) für Reisen, Technik und vieles mehr.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zeit zum Auftanken: &lt;/strong&gt;Mit 30 Urlaubstagen pro Jahr (bei einer 40-Stunden-Woche) sorgst du für den perfekten Ausgleich zwischen Arbeit und Erholung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verpflegung für Gewinner: &lt;/strong&gt;Wir kümmern uns um dich. In unseren Hubs steht dir jederzeit ein gut gefüllter Kühlschrank mit frischen Snacks, Getränken und Obst zur Verfügung – damit du bestens versorgt bist, wenn dich der Hunger packt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unvergessliche Momente:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir sind mehr als nur ein Team. Von unserem legendären jährlichen Ski-Trip über Weihnachtsfeiern bis hin zu Auftritten unserer eigenen Picnic-Band: Wir feiern unsere Erfolge gemeinsam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individuelle Mobilität:&lt;/strong&gt; Du entscheidest, wie du zu uns kommst. Wir bieten ein subventioniertes Deutschlandticket und ein „Lease-a-Bike“-Programm an.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lerne &amp;amp; wachse:&lt;/strong&gt; Profitiere von internen Lern- &amp;amp; Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten durch spannende Workshops und intensive Bootcamps, um deine Skills ständig zu erweitern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 14px;"&gt;Bereit für die Herausforderung? Dann bewirb dich, werde Teil des Picnic Teams und hilf uns dabei, zum besten Milchmann in Deutschland zu werden!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:head-of-data-ai-customer-omnic:
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8"&gt;Reporting directly to the &lt;strong data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="26"&gt;Head of Unit Customer &amp;amp; Omnicommerce&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive the unit’s overarching Data &amp;amp; AI strategy. Your primary mission is to orchestrate our transformation into a fully &lt;strong data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="193"&gt;AI-Powered enterprise&lt;/strong&gt;, combining strategic vision, robust data governance, and operational execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="9"&gt;Acting as a trusted business partner, you will unlock value across all customer touchpoints by accelerating the adoption of next-generation AI capabilities, modernizing our data stack, and scaling analytics across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="11"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="3"&gt;Key Objectives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="12"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="12,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Strategic Alignment &amp;amp; AI Acceleration:&lt;/strong&gt; Fast-track next-generation AI capabilities, focusing on Agentic Commerce, Algorithmic Ranking, Retail Media, and predictive tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="12,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; Trust:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish an enterprise-grade Federated Semantic Layer, transition to objective data governance, and own Consent Management, Privacy tracking, and behavioral analytics migrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="12,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Simplify the data ecosystem by decommissioning over 50% of legacy BI dashboards and achieving 100% compliance with global Data Governance maturity standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="12,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="12,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Analytics Democratization:&lt;/strong&gt; Shift from static reporting to conversational AI analytics, enabling self-service discovery for tens of thousands of users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="14"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="3"&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="15"&gt;1. Data Strategy, Architecture &amp;amp; Tooling&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="16"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="16,0,0"&gt;Architect and scale the overarching Semantic Layer across all business domains to create a single source of truth for critical KPIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="16,1,0"&gt;Manage end-to-end vendor lifecycles (RFPs, negotiations, migrations) for Behavioral Analytics and Consent Management platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="16,2,0"&gt;Drive aggressive decommissioning of legacy analytics environments to fund automated data products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="17"&gt;2. Business Partnership &amp;amp; AI Delivery&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="18"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="18,0,0"&gt;Serve as the strategic bridge between Business Units, the central Data Center of Excellence, and Product teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="18,1,0"&gt;Deploy top-funnel AI initiatives, including hyper-contextual search engines, advanced recommendation engines, Next Best Action algorithms, and personalization at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="18,2,0"&gt;Act as the primary Data &amp;amp; AI representative for global business performance steering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="19"&gt;3. Team Leadership &amp;amp; Organizational Design&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="20"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,0,0"&gt;Restructure and lead cross-functional data teams spanning 360 Analytics, Data Governance, and Privacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,1,0"&gt;Foster a high-performing culture through continuous mentoring and leadership development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,2,0"&gt;Lead complex change management initiatives, including organizational streamlining, geographic hub strategies, and talent retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="22"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="22" data-index-in-node="3"&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="23"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="23,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Professional Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep domain knowledge in Data Analytics, Machine Learning, and Generative AI frameworks. Hands-on understanding of modern data stacks (e.g., Databricks, dbt, Core Data Mart modeling).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="23,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Vendor Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record leading large-scale, multi-million-dollar tech transformations, executing complex RFPs, and conducting technical/legal audits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="23,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to challenge the status quo, translate complex technical concepts for C-level executives, and deliver measurable ROI through organizational change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="2"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="3"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 days of remote work per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Office Choice:&lt;/strong&gt; Opportunity to work from any of Decathlon Digital’s hubs in Lille, Paris, or Amsterdam.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Workplace Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Hardware suited to your role and aligned with our corporate social responsibility commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebook).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Global Network:&lt;/strong&gt; A local project team embedded within a global network (offering international career growth opportunities).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive skill development and guidance (diverse projects, technical certifications within your first year, internal/external training programs, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,5,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,5,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Compensation Package:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive package including employee stock ownership and monthly/quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That's exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:enterprise-account-executive-3:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;This is an exciting time for Forter as we have seen great success in the market and are building a team to support the growth.&amp;nbsp; We are looking for a talented and self-driven Enterprise Account Executive that thrives in a dynamic sales cycle environment to join the Forter Sales team. The successful candidate will play a fundamental role in achieving our ambitious customer acquisition and revenue growth objectives in the UK.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you'll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Work closely with a large list of named enterprise prospect accounts, utilizing a consultative approach to identify pain points and challenges that Forter's fraud prevention platform can help solve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Manage a sales pipeline and process from initial outreach to presentation, negotiation, and close&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to drive leads and account activity, as well as with our Pre-sales Solutions Consultants to create customized sales presentations and tailored ROI models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Identify and build relationships with economic champions / buyers within major accounts and position Forter's value proposition to the appropriate lines of business and technical teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Provide field analysis and feedback internally to help shape sales collateral and longer term expansion planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Build a strong understanding of the online payments industry, including credit card issuing/acquiring experience and familiarity with its ecosystem (partners, resellers, processors)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Represent Forter at industry events and sales meetings with key eCommerce players&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you'll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Minimum of 5 years as a top quota carrying direct sales executive, with a track record of outperforming targets and annual quotas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Proven success in selling innovative solutions/services to enterprise is a must; with a focus on FinTech and Payment solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;A strong network with a proven track record of enterprise sales within top eCommerce and online business companies is a big plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;The ability to build strong relationships, as demonstrated through prior experience prospecting and leveraging industry contacts to develop and close new businesses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Experience in a fast-paced scale-up, with the ability to work in a rapidly expanding and changing environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Exceptional professional presence, with outstanding presentation and communication skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Ability to travel as required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; commission plan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Private health insurance, including vision and dental coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Generous PTO policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Half day Fridays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Commerce is evolving faster than the systems built to support it. Agentic AI is redrawing how people buy. Customer expectations have a new ceiling. And bad actors are evolving alongside every advancement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Forter was built to meet this moment — and stay ahead of it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;We are a human-first, AI-built company. Our technology analyzes patterns across a network of over 2 billion shoppers, delivering identity intelligence across the entire commerce journey — from sign-up to checkout to returns — that protects revenue and unlocks great customer experiences simultaneously. With Forter, businesses know who to trust, whether it’s humans or the agents shopping for them. The result: zero friction for the customers who matter. No revenue left behind.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;The world's most trusted brands — Nordstrom, Instacart, Priceline, Adobe, ASOS, and eBay among them — rely on Forter to get this right. Since 2013, we've raised $525M from investors including Tiger Global, Bessemer, Sequoia Capital, and Salesforce Ventures, and today we power commerce decisions for nearly 1 million businesses globally. We're more than fraud, payments and orchestration – we make trust a competitive advantage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust is backed by data –&amp;nbsp; Forter is a recipient of over 10 workplace and innovation awards, including:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Great Place to Work Certification (2021, 2022, 2023, 2024,&lt;a href="https://www.greatplacetowork.com/certified-company/7039960"&gt; 2025&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Fortune’s Best Workplaces in NYC (2022, 2023, 2024 and&lt;a href="https://www.greatplacetowork.com/best-workplaces/new-york/2024?category=small-and-medium"&gt; 2025&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Forbes Cloud 100 (2021, 2022, 2023, 2024 and &lt;a href="https://www.forbes.com/lists/cloud100/?sh=5675f5797d9c"&gt;2025&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Anti-Fraud Solution of the Year at the Payments Awards (&lt;a href="https://www.payments-awards.com/awards/winners24.php"&gt;2024&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life as a Forterian:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Forterians are, genuinely, some of the best people you'll work with. Smart, curious, and deeply good humans who care about the work and each other. That's not an accident — it's something we've been intentional about since day one, and it's the thing people mention most when they talk about why they stay. When you're surrounded by people like this, doing work that actually matters, it changes what a job can feel like.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Forter was built on a simple but powerful conviction: when AI does its job, humans can do theirs better. That philosophy shapes our products and shapes how we work. AI is core to our workflows — not as a shortcut, but as a force multiplier that gives Forterians the space to focus their energy where human judgment is irreplaceable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;We're a global team of 500+ people, with regional headquarters in New York, Tel Aviv, London, and Singapore, and employee presence across the US, Canada, Germany, France, Japan, China, and Australia. Our teams are cross-functional by design, and the work you do here is visible, consequential, and connected to the outcomes that matter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;You'll have real ownership here and proximity to decisions. And we back that with investment in your growth — RSU offerings, L&amp;amp;D programs built around AI tools, and a culture of recognition rooted in our 4.5 day weeks (aka Forter’s Appreciation Fridays and Sundays). From team outings to local cultural celebrations, we mark the moments that matter — wherever you are in the world. We don't want Forter to be just another job. We want it to be the place you build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;If you're ready to work on a problem that sits at the intersection of AI, commerce, and human trust, this is it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Forter is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that will consider all qualified applicants, regardless of race, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, marital status, gender identity or expression, national origin, genetics, age, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need assistance or an accommodation due to a disability, please email us at ----- This information will be treated as confidential and used only for the purpose of determining an appropriate accommodation for the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Forter does not accept agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to Forter (or any related) jobs alias or directly to any Forter employees. Forter will not be responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class="p1"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.forter.com/job-applicant-privacy-policy/" target="_blank"&gt;Forter's Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-design-engineer-design-:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI's operational blind spots into operational clarity. World's leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there's a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, design has to scale across a complex, enterprise-grade process intelligence platform, and increasingly, it has to scale to machines as well as people. AI coding agents now generate a growing share of the UI our engineers ship, and our design system is the contract that keeps that output on-brand, accessible, and consistent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of design, engineering, and product, with a strong emphasis on craft, usability, and scalability. You'll design and build the system itself, owning interaction decisions and front-end architecture, and translating complex process data and AI-driven behaviors into intuitive, high-performance experiences. It's a senior role: you'll often operate with minimal design oversight, set standards, lead initiatives, and mentor others while staying deeply hands-on in both design and code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You'll join the team that owns Celonis's design system and the operations behind how design gets done. We sit at the intersection of design and engineering, and we treat the system as a living product with real users, internal designers, product engineers, and the AI agents that now consume it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you'll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build production components in Angular and TypeScript, our design system is built in Angular and we may adopt React over time, on a foundation of rock-solid HTML and CSS (semantic markup, ARIA, and modern CSS custom properties driving design tokens).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own interaction decisions, component design, and front-end architecture end-to-end, independently translating ambiguous requirements into thoughtful, usable UX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex process-intelligence data and AI-driven behaviors into clear, intuitive, high-performance operator experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical and craft standard for front-end quality, polish, motion and animation, performance, and accessibility, across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive rapid prototyping to explore novel interaction concepts and turn ambitious design visions into distinctive, testable experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with designers, PMs, and engineers to derive and evolve the design system through a healthy contribution model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the system agent-ready: maintain tokens-as-code in the W3C DTCG format (Style Dictionary or similar) and structure component metadata, docs, and APIs so AI coding agents can consume them as reliable context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author and maintain Figma Code Connect mappings so Figma components link cleanly to their coded counterparts for engineers and agents alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build evals as guardrails, visual-regression, accessibility, and token-compliance checks in CI, so generated and contributed UI meets the bar before it ships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tooling daily (Figma Make, v0, Cursor, Claude Code, Copilot, or similar), applying senior design and engineering judgment to critique and correct the output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead system initiatives and mentor designers and engineers contributing to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you'll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around 5–8 years across design engineering / UX engineering / front-end, including significant hands-on work building a design system or component library in a SaaS or B2B environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent UX instincts with strong attention to interaction detail and usability, you can own design decisions independently, with minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong production front-end skills in Angular and TypeScript with rock-solid HTML and CSS fundamentals; experience with (or genuine openness to) React is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of design token architecture (primitive → semantic → component tiers) and modern token pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Figma fluency and comfort moving fluidly between design and code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated accessibility expertise (WCAG 2.2) implemented in code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on fluency with AI design and coding tools, and an opinionated, responsible point of view on using them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong product mindset and bias toward ownership, plus the communication and leadership of a senior IC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Figma Code Connect in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or integrating MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers e.g. the Figma Dev Mode MCP server or a custom design-system MCP server.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building evals for AI-generated UI, or writing specs/prompts for AI generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working on complex, data-dense, or real-time interfaces (a strong fit for our process-intelligence product).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Token-pipeline experience with Style Dictionary, Tokens Studio, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior role: you'll own major areas of the system with full autonomy, design and ship with a high bar for craft, set the standards others build to, lead initiatives, and mentor. We pair design craft with engineering depth and high curiosity about AI, building a system that's faster and safer for humans and agents alike.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested" data-stringify-type="unordered-list" data-list-tree="true" data-indent="0" data-border="0"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time "Celonaut" is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated "Wellness Weeks" that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="1264"&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
